calling form, an explanation of its inputs and result, examples and links to \
the surrounding workflow."}], "GuideAbstract"],
  Cell[TextData[{"If you are deciding where to begin, use the ",
     ButtonBox["main guide", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/guide/HEPCAT"], " or ",
     ButtonBox["Getting Started", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/tutorial/GettingStarted"], ". The \
